  "basis": "Explicit compatibility review of these 16 hero kits and existing Hex route/choice conditions only; not a Rift cooperation review, eligibility pool or popularity claim. Effects 1305 and 2132 reviewed on 2026-10-24; prior hero reviews unchanged. Lillia has a separate community-route-only review. On 2026-10-24 reviewed TheBoomAndTheBass trigger only; Yasuo community kit anchor remains separate. Gluttonous Greaves3008 condition reviewed for the new Yasuo route; unresolved tooltip coefficients are not restated. On 2026-10-24 reviewed DoubleTime and ArmoredImpact trigger descriptions and conditional item dependencies for six separately scoped creator-inspired community directions; no shared hero or popularity review renewed. On 2026-10-24 reviewed GetJinxed and TakeemDownDownDown triggers plus the current map12 Hubris126697, Serylda6694, EndlessHunger2517 and Youmuu3142 item dependencies for the separate Hecarim creator route; no rocket damage coefficient or permanent movement-speed claim. On 2026-10-24 reviewed current BEES, StillHere, WeaponOfDestiny and Recursion summaries and community-only Ekko/Graves/Corki kit anchors. Gear3100/4645 checked for map12. Unresolved CrimsonCobalt SpellName and cooldown text remain unmodified and unadmitted. WeaponOfDestiny full tooltip is independently fingerprinted for its non-resale cost; a detailed-only change withdraws the route. On 2026-10-25 reviewed LichBrain current bonus-health-to-AP text, community-only Malphite/TahmKench kit anchors, and map12 FrozenHeart/Thornmail/DuskAndDawn dependencies. Reddit author only supplies W priority, not a complete skill order. Older video map context is explicitly unresolved in visible source details; no shared hero review renewed. Additional current-only Kaisa/Teemo community anchors and 4646/6655/3118 conditional item effects reviewed; Teemo mushroom route requires R and cannot treat BEES as ultimate damage. New source anecdotes do not establish complete augment eligibility or popularity. On 2026-10-25 independently reviewed community-only Taric/KSante/Jax kit anchors and six map12 author item dependencies. MadScientist exclusive respawn states and FinalForm R/cooldown cost are full-tooltip fingerprinted. No permanent R armor, old KSante armor-to-AD, zero cooldown or all-hit trigger claims admitted; unparsed item coefficients are not restated. On 2026-10-25 reviewed community-only Morgana/Nautilus/Udyr source kits and current control triggers1018/1375/1323 plus optional1318. Unknown combat counters remain unresolved; 1318 mobile stasis numbers require complete detailed text,1323 delays/limits retain their own detailed fingerprint. 3119 is only the purchasable evolution path, not unearned3121 effects; Udyr EH and unnamed boots are not inferred. No shared kit review or popularity renewed. On 2026-10-25 reviewed five exact summoner/movement augment summaries and four item dependencies for two dated DeepARAM editorial references. Zoe missile stacking and Poltergeist double triggers remain unknown; Quinn2077/2078 spell binding remains unadmitted. Only two independent community kit anchors added; no shared hero review renewed.",
